  "title": "Sausage Smothered in Red Cabbage",
  "description": "My grandmother used to make this red cabbage and sausage dish. To pamper your budget, serve with mashed potatoes, mustard pickle, and pumpernickel bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen Long"
